  "body": "## What changed\n\n- `crates/ui/src/play_precalc.rs`: a new line under the simulation transport. While the active setup's Stock row is hidden, it says:\n\n  > The stock is hidden, so the material removal is not shown. Show the Stock row in the Browser to see it.\n\n  - The text is `STOCK_HIDDEN_NOTE`. `stock_hidden_note(state)` reads `State::active_stock_hidden()`, the same test that the playback draw uses to skip the stock.\n  - `transport_row` draws the line before it checks for a playback worker. Thus the line shows whether or not the stock removal is calculated.\n  - The line is display state only: no command, nothing undoable, and nothing that the Deviate verdict or the post reads.\n- The simulation still draws no stock body while the row is hidden. The issue let the maintainer choose between a hint and a forced stock body. This PR takes the hint. `docs/decisions/3315-hidden-stock-hint.md` gives the reasons and the cost to change it.\n\n## Readings\n\nThe seeded shell document (one generated operation), through the UI test harness:\n\n| State | Line under the transport |\n|---|---|\n| Simulate, Stock shown | none |\n| Simulate, Stock hidden (Browser eye) | the hint |\n| Simulate, Stock shown again | none |\n| Stock hidden, no simulation | none |\n\n## Pinning tests\n\n- `egui_app::tests::transport_precalc::a_hidden_stock_is_said_under_the_transport` (ui lib). It asserts the table above through AccessKit. It also asserts that the text names the Stock row and the Browser and has no G-code word.\n  - With the `ui.label` call removed, the test fails at \"the transport says the stock is hidden\".\n\n## Gates\n\nOn the head bce5362ef:\n\n- Quick gate (`cargo xtask gate quick --base upstream/main`): 10 steps, 0 failed, 0 stalled (2.7 min). It includes `ui suites: lib`.\n- `cargo clippy --no-deps --all-targets -p camcraft-ui -- -D warnings`: clean.\n- Heavy lanes: the diff reaches none (`cargo xtask gate heavy --base upstream/main --dry-run`: 0 steps reached).\n\n## Not exercised\n\n- No check by hand in the GUI. The test reads the line through AccessKit in the real shell.\n- No screenshot. The line is one plain text label under the transport bar, in the style of the precalculation line above it.\n\nChangelog: Simulate says when the stock is hidden: with the Stock row hidden in the Browser, the line under the transport says why no material removal is shown.\n\nBranch made from `upstream/main` at 97a676e5c.\n\nFixes #3315\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n",
